('p', 'Pronouns are personal (*I, you, he*), reflexive (*myself*), demonstrative (*this, those*), interrogative (*who, what*), relative (*who, which, that*), indefinite (*someone, none*), distributive (*each, either*) and reciprocal (*each other*). Details in Chapter 3.'),
